{
  "overview": {
    "en": "Remotion video creation skills — best practices, animations, audio, captions, 3D, and more for building programmatic videos with React.\n\nDevelop a video from a clear script and production brief. Specify duration, aspect ratio, and source assets; review the proposed structure before producing the final output.\n\nUse this plugin in a Ghast conversation with the relevant inputs or project context. The bundled workflow guides the task; any required external tools or runtime must be available in your environment.",
    "zh-CN": "使用 React 制作视频，处理动画、音频、字幕与三维效果。\n\n根据明确脚本和制作简报完成视频，说明时长、画面比例与源素材，在产出成片前审阅拟议结构。\n\n在 Ghast 对话中提供相关输入或项目背景后使用本插件。随附流程会指导任务；所需外部工具或运行环境仍需在本机可用。"
  },
